# Only peer-reviewed sources

The listener wants only **peer-reviewed** work: papers published in a journal or in conference proceedings (an arXiv version of such a paper is fine). No plain preprints, blogs, news or reports. The server drops every source not marked as peer-reviewed.
{% elif source_filter | default("all") == "top" %}
# Only top sources

The listener wants only **top work**: papers at a top venue of the field (main track of e.g. NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, CVPR, ACL; Nature, Science, PNAS, the field's flagship journals), or top papers by citations. The server drops every source not marked as top-tier.
{% endif %}{% if research_mode | default("episode") == "overview" %}
